        },
        {
          "text": "Mbubonya obo, anywebo nobanakazi, amulibombye kubalumi banu nobeni, kuti kwanooli bamwi bataswiililisyi kumakani, basanduke nkaambo kanyendelo zyabakazi babo, kuti tabaambilwi zintu, ",
