        {
          "text": "Anywebo nobalumi, mbubonya obo, amukale kabotu abakazi banu, nkaambo mukazi uli mbuli cilongo cikompeme, mulumi nguuinda inguzu, Amubalemeke, mbobali baswaananyoko kubuumi mbomuti pegwe, kuti kukomba kwanu kutabi kwabuyo.",
