                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutabweedezyi cibi kucibi, naaba matusi kumatusi, pe, embo, pele amubweedezye kulongezya. Nkaambo nciconya eci, ncimwakaitilwa, kuti mukavube zilongezyo nobeni, ",
