                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pele amulemeke Kristo mumyoyo yanu kuti ngo-Mwami. Amube balibambide lyoonse, kuti mubapandulwide boonse bamubuzya makani aalusyomo lumukalilide, pele amuvuwe amoyo mutete akuyoowa Leza. ",
